14#issuecomment-4267486993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117714","id":4267486993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-XK8R","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T11:08:20Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T11:08:20Z","body":"I went over the log files, but couldn't find anything suspicious. But searching about the `...watchdog: BUG: soft lockup - CPU#9 stuck...` message suggests a possible hardware issue. Does this only occur with Godot, or has something similar happened with other programs before? (Or on Windows too?)\n\nI noticed you have `memtest` available during boot; could you try running the test to confirm there aren't any memory errors? (Be warned, the test likely takes a couple of hours to complete)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4267486993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is